OL,3,GNEWSAResidents return home as
OL,4,Asuspicious object is taken away
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents at the centre of an overnight
OL,7,Fsecurity alert in Ballymena, County
OL,8,FAntrim, have been allowed to return
OL,9,Fhome.
OL,11,FPolice said they were called to the
OL,12,FMoorfields Road area on Friday morning
OL,13,Ffollowing reports of a suspicious
OL,14,Fobject.
OL,16,FA search was carried out and a cordon
OL,17,Fput in place near the main road between
OL,18,FBallymena and Moorfields village. Two
OL,19,Fhouses were evacuated.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
